OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 3, injured in crocodile
OL,4,Aattack returns home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA three-year-old boy who was seriously
OL,7,Finjured in a crocodile enclosure has
OL,8,Fbeen discharged from hospital and is
OL,9,Fsettling back in at home, his family
OL,10,Fhas said.
OL,12,FThe child returned home "a few weeks
OL,13,Fago" and is "happy to be home, playing
OL,14,Fwith his toys, sleeping in his own bed
OL,15,Fand being a big brother", his parents
OL,16,Fsaid in an update posted online.
OL,18,FThe boy was visiting Johnsons of Old
OL,19,FHurst near Huntingdon, Cambridgeshire,
OL,20,Fwith his family on 18 June when he was
OL,21,Fattacked by at least one of the
OL,22,Fanimals.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
